  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Sometimes, a topic can't quite stand on its own, or needs a particular inflection. Fixing this is a specialty of yours.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Warrior Poet 9</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose one of your haiku. Each of the chosen haiku's subjects may contain an additional topic with an On cost of 1; however, this additional topic fulfill one of the following two conditions:<br>\n1. The topic is a kitsune's ventriloquism.<br>\n2. The topic's only function is to modify the other topics in a subject.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/onmyodo-feats#toc24\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
